msgid "Deploying"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When deployment is enabled, the Kubernetes extension will select the "
"resources specified by `quarkus.kubernetes.deployment-target` and deploy "
"them.\n"
"This assumes that a `.kube/config` is available in your user directory that "
"points to the target Kubernetes cluster.\n"
"In other words the extension will use whatever cluster `kubectl` uses. The "
"same applies to credentials."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"At the moment no additional options are provided for further customization."
